@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-04, FR-13, FR-14, FR-15, FR-16
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/pages/StudentCourses.jsx, backend/src/services/conversation.service.js, backend/src/services/qa.service.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-17
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依多輪 Conversation API 與 QA citation contract 產出循序圖
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title Web多輪RAG問答與引用回傳循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "學生" as Student

box "React SPA" #FAFBFB
  participant "StudentCourses" as CoursePage
  participant "apiFetch()" as ApiClient
end box

box "Conversation layer" #FAFBFB
  participant "ConversationController" as ConversationController
  participant "ConversationService" as ConversationService
  database "Conversation / Message models" as ConversationModels
end box

box "QA layer" #FAFBFB
  participant "CourseAccessService" as AccessService
  participant "QaService" as QaService
  participant "FaqCacheService" as FaqCache
  participant "QueryEmbeddingService" as EmbeddingService
  participant "Retrieval services" as Retrieval
  participant "AnswerGenerationService" as AnswerService
  database "Question / UsageLog models" as AuditModels
end box

Student -> CoursePage : 輸入問題並送出
opt 尚無對話
  CoursePage -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/conversations\n{ courseId }
  ApiClient -> ConversationController : createConversation()
  ConversationController -> ConversationService : createConversation({ user, courseId })
  ConversationService -> AccessService : assertCanAccessCourse(user, course)
  AccessService --> ConversationService : active Enrollment + published Course
  ConversationService -> ConversationModels : Conversation.create()
  ConversationModels --> ConversationService : Conversation
  ConversationService --> ConversationController : conversation view
  ConversationController --> ApiClient : 201 { conversationId }
  ApiClient --> CoursePage : 保留 conversationId
end

CoursePage -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages\n{ content }
ApiClient -> ConversationController : sendMessage()
ConversationController -> ConversationService : sendMessage({ user, conversationId, content })
ConversationService -> ConversationModels : 載入 Conversation 並驗證 owner
ConversationService -> AccessService : assertCanAccessCourse(user, course)
ConversationService -> ConversationModels : 讀取近期歷史；Message.create(user)
ConversationService -> ConversationService : contextualizeQuestion()
ConversationService -> QaService : askQuestion(original, standalone, history)
QaService -> AccessService : assertCanAccessCourse()
QaService -> FaqCache : findFaqByExactQuestion()

alt 當前 scope 內的 FAQ 命中
  FaqCache --> QaService : cached answer + supporting evidence
  QaService -> AuditModels : 寫入 UsageLog + Question
else FAQ miss
  QaService -> EmbeddingService : embedQuery(standaloneQuestion)
  EmbeddingService --> QaService : queryVector
  QaService -> FaqCache : findFaqBySimilarEmbedding()
  alt 語意 FAQ 命中且引用仍有效
    FaqCache --> QaService : cached answer + supporting evidence
    QaService -> AuditModels : 寫入 UsageLog + Question
  else 正式檢索
    QaService -> Retrieval : Leaf / gated hierarchy search\n(course + video allowlist)
    Retrieval --> QaService : ranked matches + diagnostics
    alt 無充分證據
      QaService -> AuditModels : 寫入 NO_MATCH 與 runtime
      QaService --> ConversationService : no-answer + answerStatus + citations=[]
    else 有可用片段
      QaService -> AnswerService : generateAnswer(question, matches, history)
      AnswerService --> QaService : answer + supportingEvidenceIds
      QaService -> AuditModels : 寫入 UsageLog + Question
      QaService -> FaqCache : 必要時儲存無降級單輪答案
      QaService --> ConversationService : answer + citations + answerStatus + runtime
    end
  end
end

ConversationService -> ConversationModels : Message.create/update(assistant, sources)
ConversationService --> ConversationController : answer + sources + runtime
ConversationController --> ApiClient : 201 Message answered
ApiClient --> CoursePage : 顯示回答與可點擊 citation card
CoursePage --> Student : 跳至授權影片時間點

note over QaService,AnswerService
  citations 只能來自回答實際採用的 supportingEvidenceIds。
  matches[] 為 legacy/debug 相容欄位，不能取代 citations。
end note

@enduml
